            "detailed_description": "Construct the infrastructure to rebuild civilization. Set up supply lines, mine skyscrapers for plastics, and find a place to process all the poop your people will generate. You have twenty minutes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/8c662896e2a55134f0ffc43fe470fc37.poster.avif?t=1599160743\" width=552 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/8c662896e2a55134f0ffc43fe470fc37.webm?t=1599160743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/8c662896e2a55134f0ffc43fe470fc37.mp4?t=1599160743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEED YOUR PEOPLE</h2><br>Farms generate food—those are the green dots you see below. All food is bright green. That's how you know it's fresh.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/c566325c6af269179c5f4c9adf85963c.poster.avif?t=1599160743\" width=552 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/c566325c6af269179c5f4c9adf85963c.webm?t=1599160743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/c566325c6af269179c5f4c9adf85963c.mp4?t=1599160743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONVERT FOOD TO WORK</h2><br>Build apartments. People will take in food and generate work. And they'll poop. But you don't have to worry about the poop right now.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/a7f676e5c2fbf3b72642a37c69880ae1.poster.avif?t=1599160743\" width=552 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/a7f676e5c2fbf3b72642a37c69880ae1.webm?t=1599160743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/700200/extras/a7f676e5c2fbf3b72642a37c69880ae1.mp4?t=1599160743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAILS TRANSPORT RESOURCES</h2><br>Trails will convey resources like food and work between buildings. There's a limit to the volume of resources they can carry at any given time, so you'll need to plan your layout carefully.<br><br>Extend your reach by cutting through forest and... Uh oh...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR APARTMENTS ARE FULL OF POOP</h2>So, you build a landfill to take care of the poop. Where was I? Cut through forest to get to ancient skyscrapers, which you'll mine for metals and plastics—you're an ace recycler!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU HAVE DEFORESTED THE FOREST</h2>Time to expand to other forests! But try not to tear them all down. Set up a water turbine and energy transmitters to power your search for more trees. And build some parks for points. Now you're cooking. Build a dozen high rises. More parks!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AND YOU'RE OUT OF TIME</h2>You just rebuilt an entire civilization in 20 minutes! That's no mean feat. Heck, it's going to take folks 30 minutes to do it in the sequel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO 20 MINUTE METROPOLIS!</h2>",
